---
source: crates/dreamd-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "subcommand_help(\"watch\")"
---
Run the daemon in foreground mode. Blocks until SIGINT/SIGTERM

Usage: watch [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --bind <ADDR>
          TCP listen address (not Unix): an IP or IP:port, e.g. 127.0.0.1:8080 or [::1]:0. Port defaults to 0 (OS-chosen). Hostnames are not resolved. Default: 127.0.0.1:0

      --insecure
          Allow a non-loopback --bind (not Unix). Logs a warning on every start. Does not disable the bearer token, and ~/.agent/server.json still names a loopback address

  -h, --help
          Print help
